OL,3,ACrew in Lewis fishing boat tragedy
OL,4,Anamed by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree fishermen who were on boat that
OL,7,Fwent missing off the Western Isles on
OL,8,FTuesday have been named.
OL,10,FThe body of Douglas Craigie, 49, was
OL,11,Ffound on Wednesday morning, while his
OL,12,Fcrew-mates, Norman Murray, who is 40
OL,13,Fand known as Tam, and 23-year-old Murdo
OL,14,FMorrison are still missing.
OL,16,FTheir fishing boat, called Kilda,
OL,17,Fdisappeared during stormy weather off
OL,18,FPort of Ness in north Lewis.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
