OL,3,ACrew in Lewis fishing boat tragedy
OL,4,Anamed by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsles MP Torcuil Crichton said the
OL,7,Fislands had been "struck by a maritime
OL,8,Ftragedy", and First Minister John
OL,9,FSwinney said his heart went out to the
OL,10,Fmen's families.
